rios/m3.ts`; M4 (`scenarios/m4.ts`) reruns the M3 cases on\n  `responses`, rewriting chat replies with `responsesFromChat`.\n>>>>>>> wip\n- Review scenarios script the fake with `scriptedServer` (`replies.ts`),\n  keyed by `<model>#<turns>` like the request groups. A first finder\n  call has 3 messages, a first verifier call 2; an unscripted key gets\n  a 404 naming it. Credential variables must not start with a scrubbed\n  prefix (`ROAST_`, `OPENAI_`, ...): `scrubbedEnv` drops them.\n- Go-only incidental bytes are normalized, not allowlisted: SDK headers\n  (`X-Stainless-*`), Go's `\\u003c` HTML escaping (records compare as\n  parsed JSON, including `provider-responses.jsonl`), gzip/zstd bytes","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_016xWYVJ9U5ciotxpCFTm4eH","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
